physicalRef: procurement_approval_links
description: "Bid rigging and procurement fraud Link Analysis showcase - Derived from procurement_links each time it is produced, for the saved view official_approving_relative_firm: every approved_change link (official to the firm that won the tender), the home addresses that two or more of those officials and those firms' directors share (lives_at), and the directorships of the people at those homes (directed_by). Same columns as procurement_links. Synthetic."
eventDate: event_date
